        },
        "texto": "See also Ezekiel 22:28. Kitto is of the opinion that reference is here made to “cob-walls”; that is, walls which are made of beaten earth rammed into molds or boxes, to give shape and consistence, and then emptied from the molds, layer by layer, on the wall, where it dries as the…"
