          "modulo": "freeman-manners-customs"
        },
        "texto": "It is not by any means certain that the customs alluded to in this text can, at this late day, be explained. Other interpretations, however, have been given of the passage. Instead of “armholes” or “elbows” some authorities have, as a more literal interpretation, “joints of the h…"
      }
